note dl/dl.om: ForgeDownloads unit of forged (fns dl*, globals gd*, texts td*). Contract v1.
note Routes under /<owner>/<repo> (fridx set by the server, GET and HEAD only):
note   /archive/refs/heads/<b>.zip|.tar.gz   /archive/refs/tags/<t>.zip|.tar.gz
note   /archive/<sha-or-ref>.zip|.tar.gz      (7..40 hex: a commit reachable from a canonical ref)
note   /releases  /releases/latest  /releases/tag/<t>  /releases/download/<t>/<asset>
note Refs resolve at the storage root first (refs/heads, refs/tags), then in the delegate namespace
note refs/namespaces/<tfnid>/refs/... . git runs as an argv exec (fkgit), never through a shell.
note Archives: git archive into ~/forge-data/archives/<rid>/<sha>-<h16>.<ext>, h16 = the first 16 hex
note of sha256(prefix), because the prefix <repo>-<ref>/ is inside the bytes. Total cache cap 5 GiB
note (5368709120 bytes), one file at most 512 MiB (536870912); eviction is least recently used by
note ctime (a cache hit chmods the file, which sets its ctime). Release assets (files in the tag's
note release-assets/ dir) are cached as <blob>.blob the same way. Every cached file gets a sidecar
note <file>.sha256 (64 hex) computed in Omega by om/tls/sha2.om.
note dlclone appends the clone panel (rad clone, git over HTTPS, archive links) for the repo header.
global gdp uchar 4096
global gdpl ulong 1
global gdf uchar 4096
global gdfl ulong 1
global gdref uchar 256
global gdrefl ulong 1
global gdkind ulong 1
global gdfmt ulong 1
global gdsha uchar 40
global gdh16 uchar 16
global gdpre uchar 512
global gdprel ulong 1
global gdst uchar 128
global gdsize ulong 1
global gdws uchar 4
global gdent uchar 16384
global gdent2 uchar 16384
global gdold uchar 4096
global gdoldl ulong 1
global gdoldc ulong 1
global gdtot ulong 1
global gdsub uchar 256
global gdsubl ulong 1
global gdhex uchar 64
global gdtl uchar 1048576
global gdtll ulong 1
global gdrec ulong 512
global gdrend ulong 512
global gdrn ulong 1
global gdso ulong 512
global gdsl ulong 512
global gdco ulong 512
global gdkeep ulong 512
global gdkn ulong 1
global gdlat ulong 1
global gdfa ulong 1
global gdfn ulong 1
global gdan ulong 1
global gdab uchar 2560
global gdasz ulong 64
global gdanm uchar 8192
global gdanl ulong 64
global gdasn uchar 128
global gdasnl ulong 1
global gdwant uchar 128
global gdwantl ulong 1
global gdcold ulong 2
text tdarch "/archive/"
text tdheads "refs/heads/"
text tdtags "refs/tags/"
text tdns "refs/namespaces/"
text tdsrh "/refs/heads/"
text tdsrt "/refs/tags/"
text tdrh0 "refs/heads"
text tdrt0 "refs/tags"
